# Git commit messages

Commit as the human authors of this repo only.

- Do not add `Co-authored-by`, `Signed-off-by`, `Made-with`, or `Generated-by` trailers for Cursor, Claude, Copilot, ChatGPT, Codex, Composer, Gemini, or any other AI (`Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` included).
- After every commit, check `git log -1 --format=%B`. If an AI trailer is there, recreate a clean commit before push.
- Keep `.githooks/commit-msg` copied to `.git/hooks/commit-msg`.
